-# UI-0 (F3): shown in production when operator credentials are still at their default values.
%div.auth-layout
  %div.auth-card
    %h1 Configuration required
    %p
      This GraphMem instance is running with default operator credentials.
      Set
      %code OPERATOR_USERNAME
      and
      %code OPERATOR_PASSWORD
      (or
      %code Rails.application.credentials[:operator]
      ) before using this application.
